usage: csk update [-h]

options:
  -h, --help  show this help message and exit

Purpose:
  Runs git fetch --all --tags --prune for every git repo under skills_root.

Side effects:
  Mutates local skill repositories only. Projects are not modified.

Exit codes:
  0 all repos fetched, 1 one or more fetches failed, 2 config error, 3 lock contention.

Example:
  csk update
